		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 113.03 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e2e517c1-7ae6-46d6-a2f1-51c044eeaafa")
	)
	(text "MECHANICAL\nSmall PCB, held by the J2 socket alone (on the\ndisplay-facing side; all other parts outward).\n2x M3 holes on the edge opposite J2: optional\nscrews/standoffs (~11 mm) rest on the display PCB.\nUSB-C on an edge; antenna end kept clear."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 113.03 176.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ec2efe55-e0ca-4d04-ac8d-8f22c1dbac10")
	)
	(text "POWER\nUSB-C 5 V only. R1/R2 5.1K on CC1/CC2 = sink.\nF1 PTC 1.1 A, D1 TVS SMF5.0A, U3 ESD on D+/D-.\nU3 drawn flow-through: pins 1/3 connector side,\npins 6/4 ESP32 side (joined inside the chip).\nU2 buck: Vout = 0.6 V x (1 + R3/R4) = 3.32 V.\n\nDISPLAY (MSP3526 plugs straight into J2)\nVCC = 5 V: module LDO + backlight.\nLCD logic via the module 74LVC245: 3.3 V OK.\nTouch I2C has 10K pull-ups to 5 V on the\nmodule, so Q1/Q2 (BSS138) shift it to 3.3 V.\nCTP_* = capacitive touch panel signals (FT6336U).\nSPI MOSI/SCK/MISO shared by LCD and microSD.\n\nESP32-S3\nSHT40 has its own I2C bus (IO17/IO18).\nLIGHT on ADC1 (IO9); ADC2 conflicts with Wi-Fi.\nIO35-IO37 used by octal PSRAM (N16R8): NC.\n\nBOOT STRAPS / RESET"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 113.03 120.65 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "edb30575-9909-4a4a-adc6-3631bee3ae6a")
	)
	(text "EN (SW1 RESET)\nBOOT (SW2, strap)\nLIGHT (ADC1_CH8)\nSD_CS\nCTP_INT\nCTP_SDA (via Q2)\nCTP_RST\nCTP_SCL (via Q1)\nSHT_SCL\nSHT_SDA\nUSB_D- (native)\nUSB_D+ (native)\nSPI_MISO\nLCD_RST\nLCD_DC\nLCD_CS\nSPI_MOSI\nLCD_BL (PWM)\nSPI_SCK"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 255.27 63.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f2369ad4-610a-41cf-a1d1-667572f544db")
	)
	(text "RESET / BOOT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 161.29 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "fbf6dca4-ff45-4e93-a2da-25ff98c1e51d")
	)
	(text "DISPLAY CONNECTOR (MSP3526)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 113.03 59.69 0)
		(effects
			(font
